<title>USA: Citicorp expected to issue $200 mln in notes.</title>
<headline>Citicorp expected to issue $200 mln in notes.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Citicorp may issue $200 million in 15-year subordinated notes on Tuesday via Bear Stearns &amp; Co, market sources said.</p>
<p>The non-callable A2/A notes are expected to price between 75 and 77 basis points over the 10-year U.S. Treasury note, market sources added.</p>
<p>-- Caryn Trokie, 212-859-1678</p>
</text>
